__pycache__/
*.pyc
~$*
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Generated dashboards and working registers - the scripts create these.
# The negations below are SHIPPED ASSETS, not generated output. Without them a
# clone gets tools that fail on first run - which has happened once already.
*.html
*.xlsx
!TSP/TSP.3 TSP Register/tsp-manager/templates/dashboard.html
!TSP/TSP.7 Notebook Manager/notebook-capture/assets/post-template.html
!TSP/TSP.13 Stakeholder Register/stakeholder-manager/templates/dashboard.html
# The site on GitHub Pages: generated, but published, so it ships (site/build_site.py).
!docs/**/*.html

# Stakeholder contacts are other people's personal data: never in git (TD.13).
Contacts *.csv

# Registers are JSON now, and JSON is not ignored - so there is no longer a list
# of shipped-asset exceptions to keep in step with the tools. The remaining
# negations are HTML templates a tool ships: the TSP and stakeholder dashboards and the eDiary post.
PreviousV/
